guide forever/reputation/merchants-favor
title Merchant's Favor Reputation
category Reputation
levels 10-60
zone Redridge Mountains
# Azeroth Commerce Authority (2586, Alliance) and Durotar Supply and Logistics
# (2587, Horde): Forever's tradeskill factions, paid in Merchant's Favor.
# Reputation comes from crate hand-ins at each faction's camp: mobs from level
# 10 drop Waylaid Crates (Apprentice, Journeyman, Expert, Artisan); filled with
# the goods on the label, a crate becomes a Sealed Crate for the faction's trade
# representative ("A Sealed Crate", quests 91899/91900/91904/91905). Hand-in
# NPCs: Marcy Baker (256390) at Three Corners, Redridge Mountains (live frame
# 9.75,71.02), and Dokimi (256386) just outside the Crossroads (Era 50.15,29.35).
# Same camps as collectibles/mounts/*/pack-kodo and collectibles/pets/minimule.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json; Forever client 1.60.1.70338 ItemSparse
# (Waylaid Crate 248702-248713, Sealed Crate 248765-248779);
# Forever's quest data (currency 3402, Merchant's Favor);
# https://theforeverera.com/en/merchants-favor/ . How much reputation each
# crate gives is not documented, so the steps track the standing only.

step Azeroth Commerce Authority to Friendly
  only Alliance
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The Azeroth Commerce Authority is the Alliance's tradeskill faction in Forever. Its camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains. From level 10 mobs drop Waylaid Crates: fill each with the goods its label asks for and hand the Sealed Crate to Marcy Baker at the camp for reputation and Merchant's Favor. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  goto 9.8,71.0 "Marcy Baker" live
  rep 2586 Friendly

step Azeroth Commerce Authority to Honored
  only Alliance
  tip Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Marcy Baker.
  rep 2586 Honored

step Azeroth Commerce Authority to Revered
  only Alliance
  tip Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Marcy Baker.
  rep 2586 Revered

step Azeroth Commerce Authority to Exalted
  only Alliance
  tip Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Marcy Baker until Exalted.
  rep 2586 Exalted

step Durotar Supply and Logistics to Friendly
  only Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip Durotar Supply and Logistics is the Horde's tradeskill faction in Forever. Its camp is just outside the Crossroads in the Barrens. From level 10 mobs drop Waylaid Crates: fill each with the goods its label asks for and hand the Sealed Crate to Dokimi at the camp for reputation and Merchant's Favor. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  goto 50.2,29.4 "Dokimi"
  rep 2587 Friendly

step Durotar Supply and Logistics to Honored
  only Horde
  tip Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Dokimi.
  rep 2587 Honored

step Durotar Supply and Logistics to Revered
  only Horde
  tip Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Dokimi.
  rep 2587 Revered

step Durotar Supply and Logistics to Exalted
  only Horde
  tip Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Dokimi until Exalted.
  rep 2587 Exalted
